<title>SWITZERLAND: SMH sees extremely successful 1997 result.</title>
<headline>SMH sees extremely successful 1997 result.</headline>
<dateline>BIEL, Switzerland 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss watchmaker Ste Suisse Microelectronique et d'Horlogerie SA (SMH) said the company's growth in 1996 was to a large extent due to the unique company culture and this would contribute to an extremely successful result in 1997.</p>
</text>
